@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = local-demo-token-change-me
@event = 1
@reservation = replace-with-reservation-uuid

### Проверка готовности
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Дату нужно заменить на будущую
POST {{base}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Go meetup","starts_at":"2030-01-15T18:00:00Z","capacity":10}

### Список
GET {{base}}/api/v1/events?limit=20&offset=0

### Повтор этого запроса вернёт ту же бронь
POST {{base}}/api/v1/reservations
Idempotency-Key: example-request-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":{{event}},"name":"Анна"}

### Статус
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservation}}

### Подтверждение
POST {{base}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservation}}/confirm

### Отмена
POST {{base}}/api/v1/reservations/{{reservation}}/cancel
